{
  "slug": "link-button",
  "name": "Link Button",
  "title": "链接按钮",
  "category": "base",
  "files": [
    "components/link-button/link-button.tsx"
  ],
  "description": "看起来像链接的文字操作：悬停出现下划线，支持多种语气、前后图标与外部链接；传 href 渲染为 <a>，否则渲染为 <button>。",
  "keywords": [
    "link",
    "text button",
    "anchor",
    "inline action",
    "链接",
    "文字按钮",
    "超链接"
  ],
  "exports": [
    "LinkButton",
    "linkButtonClass"
  ],
  "demos": [
    {
      "file": "link-button/overview.tsx",
      "title": "概览",
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "file": "link-button/underline.tsx",
      "title": "下划线与禁用",
      "height": 220
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "size 默认 inherit，放在句子里会跟随周围文字大小。",
    "external 会在新标签页打开、加上 ↗ 图标，并为读屏补充「在新标签页打开」。",
    "导航用 href（<a>），触发动作用 onPress（<button>），不要混用。"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "component": "LinkButton",
      "description": "有 href 时其余属性透传给 React Aria Link，否则透传给 React Aria Button。",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "href",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "链接地址；不传则渲染为按钮。"
        },
        {
          "name": "tone",
          "type": "\"accent\" | \"neutral\" | \"muted\" | \"danger\"",
          "default": "\"accent\"",
          "description": "颜色。"
        },
        {
          "name": "size",
          "type": "\"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\" | \"inherit\"",
          "default": "\"inherit\"",
          "description": "文字大小。"
        },
        {
          "name": "underline",
          "type": "\"hover\" | \"always\" | \"none\"",
          "default": "\"hover\"",
          "description": "下划线显示时机。"
        },
        {
          "name": "startIcon",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "前置图标。"
        },
        {
          "name": "endIcon",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "后置图标，RTL 下自动镜像。"
        },
        {
          "name": "external",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": "false",
          "description": "外部链接（新标签页打开）。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
